arm64: dts: h713: add the HY300 Pro board dts

The HY300 Pro (issue #1: DDR3 at 636 MHz, Android 10 firmware of 2024,
project id 0x34, a 1280x720 single-port panel by every source we have) is
the first board other than the HY310 that gets a device tree of its own,
for the same reason the HY310 got one: boards/<id>/board.env names the
DTB a board boots, and a test image built for this board must not
carry another board's name.

Like sun50i-h713-hy310.dts this is an include of the hy200 dts plus model
and compatible. Nothing board-specific is known well enough to change:
fan, focus motor and power key are assumed to sit where the HY310 has
them; the panel is driven by the display coprocessor from the project id,
not by this tree. The image built from it is a TEST image for the board's
owner (doku/121 section 5, stage 5); a green report turns the board
verified and this file into the place for what differs.

diff -ruN a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
@@ -58,6 +58,7 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun50i-h700-anbernic-rg35xx-sp.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713-v2.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun50i-h713-hy310.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun50i-h713-hy300-pro.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun55i-a527-cubie-a5e.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun55i-h728-x96qpro+.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun55i-t527-avaota-a1.dtb
diff -ruN a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy300-pro.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy300-pro.dts
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy300-pro.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+/*
+ * MagCubic HY300 Pro projector (2024 board, DDR3 at 636 MHz; issue #1).
+ *
+ * The hardware description lives in sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts; this
+ * board carries its own name so that the DTB it boots is not named after
+ * somebody else's board. Fan, focus motor and power key are assumed to sit
+ * where the HY310 has them -- nothing on this board has been measured by
+ * us; its owner tests it. The panel is programmed by the display
+ * coprocessor from the declared project id (0x34), not by this tree.
+ *
+ * Same pattern as sun50i-h713-hy310.dts.
+ */
+
+#include "sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts"
+
+/ {
+	model = "MagCubic HY300 Pro";
+	compatible = "magcubic,hy300-pro", "allwinner,sun50i-h713";
+};
